WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.340
- I'm declaring, It's Taco Tuesday

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:05.309
here on the Kelly Clarkson Show!

00:00:05.309 --> 00:00:07.656
(mid-tempo music)

00:00:07.656 --> 00:00:09.383
♪ Taco Tuesday ♪

00:00:09.383 --> 00:00:10.516
♪ Tacos ♪

00:00:10.516 --> 00:00:12.118
♪ Ooh ♪

00:00:12.118 --> 00:00:14.368
(laughing)

00:00:15.436 --> 00:00:16.750
I love my band.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.960
I never actually here what's gonna happen

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:21.330
before it happens and
they're the greatest band

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:22.450
on the planet.

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:24.740
I could go on about why I love tacos

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:26.280
but here are just a few reasons.

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:28.320
Tacos are versatile, okay?

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:30.020
Just the other day we made sushi tacos,

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:31.500
here on the show, I know it sounds weird

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:32.600
but you know what?

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.900
Don't hate on it, try it.

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:37.040
Not too long ago, we made cocoa puff

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:38.170
and fruity pebble tacos.

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:42.390
That's like a sugar express
taco which I, yes yeah.

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:44.217
I mean you might die but it's good.

00:00:44.217 --> 00:00:45.050
(audience laughing)

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:46.170
It's fine.

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:48.166
Plus, tacos are the cutest food,

00:00:48.166 --> 00:00:50.500
(audience cooing)
to dress a baby as.

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:51.363
Come on!

00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:53.670
She's adorable.

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:55.198
Is that the sour cream?

00:00:55.198 --> 00:00:56.661
[Audience] Yes!

00:00:56.661 --> 00:00:58.420
(laughing)

00:00:58.420 --> 00:00:59.780
It looks like whipped cream.

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:02.080
Which let's make those tacos.

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:03.560
I love whipped cream, okay.

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:06.850
Tacos are also the reason
I have a very special guest

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:08.200
sitting in my audience.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:10.243
Will my special guest please stand up?

00:01:11.238 --> 00:01:14.535
(audience cheers)

00:01:14.535 --> 00:01:16.707
It's Danny Trejo everybody!

00:01:16.707 --> 00:01:17.540
- Hey!

00:01:19.609 --> 00:01:22.587
(laughing)

00:01:22.587 --> 00:01:23.650
- Danny!

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:25.650
Thank you!
- Will the real Danny Trejo

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:26.830
please stand up?

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:27.763
Please stand up?

00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:30.323
Wait, somebody already did that.

00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:31.402
- Thank you for coming.

00:01:31.402 --> 00:01:33.140
Thank you for coming today
and sitting in my audience,

00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:33.973
it's so awesome.

00:01:33.973 --> 00:01:35.340
So what does your shirt say?

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:37.902
Don't be negative, eat tacos.

00:01:37.902 --> 00:01:40.735
(audience cheers)

00:01:43.732 --> 00:01:46.010
All right well we all
know you Con Air, Heat

00:01:46.010 --> 00:01:48.740
and Breaking Bad but in L.A.,
you're also known for tacos.

00:01:48.740 --> 00:01:50.820
Tell us about Trejo's Tacos.

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:53.970
- Well, first of all, we've
got seven restaurants,

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:57.560
one donut shop

00:01:57.560 --> 00:02:00.910
and we even have a restaurant

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:03.600
right in the airport next to the Puck guy.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:04.433
The Puck guy?

00:02:04.433 --> 00:02:06.660
That guy, what is it?

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:07.775
- Wolfgang?

00:02:07.775 --> 00:02:09.240
(laughing)

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:10.147
- Wolfgang!

00:02:10.147 --> 00:02:12.040
The Wolfgang guy.
- You know what?

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:13.590
He's never gonna make it.
- That guy.

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:14.805
I got a restaurant.

00:02:14.805 --> 00:02:15.638
(laughing)

00:02:15.638 --> 00:02:16.471
- I never heard of him.

00:02:17.710 --> 00:02:20.530
Well I told everyone,
what I love about tacos.

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:21.530
Why do you love tacos?

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:22.640
Why did you start this?
- You know what?

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:24.570
First of all, tacos are versatile.

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:28.890
Secondly, children with autism

00:02:28.890 --> 00:02:32.570
don't do well with gluten.

00:02:32.570 --> 00:02:36.520
So we got gluten-free tacos
and we have vegetarian,

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:39.065
vegan, gluten-free.
- I'm not into the first one

00:02:39.065 --> 00:02:39.898
you said but yeah.

00:02:39.898 --> 00:02:41.600
(laughing)

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:43.600
I'm Texan, I like meat.

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:44.646
- [Audience] Whoo!

00:02:44.646 --> 00:02:45.479
- Sorry!

00:02:47.078 --> 00:02:49.000
But I'm not sorry, I love it.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:50.810
You brought some tacos today right?

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:51.650
For us?
- Absolutely.

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:52.484
- Did you bring us all some tacos?

00:02:52.484 --> 00:02:53.317
(audience cheering)

00:02:53.317 --> 00:02:55.395
- We got tacos for everyone!

00:02:55.395 --> 00:02:57.728
- Pass out the tacos, y'all.

00:02:58.806 --> 00:03:00.545
Tacos for everybody.

00:03:00.545 --> 00:03:02.705
Oh thank you, thank you for my taco.

00:03:02.705 --> 00:03:04.950
(laughing)

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:06.200
Oh my gosh!

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:07.573
Okay wait, I gotta try it.

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:12.863
Oh my god it's so good.
- Delicious.

00:03:14.633 --> 00:03:15.933
- Thank you so much Danny.

